Rules:
  [N1] Use App Router for new projects.
  [N2] Use React Server Components.
  [N3] Use Server Actions for mutations.
  [N4] Use `metadata` API for SEO.
  [N5] Use `generateStaticParams` for static pages.
  [N6] Use middleware for edge logic.
  [N7] Use `next/image` for optimized images.
  [N8] Use `next/font` for optimized fonts.

